<div id=\"thonnyFocusNote\" class=\"thonny-focus-note\"></div>\r\n170:           <div id=\"thonnyTrailChips\" class=\"thonny-trail-chips\"></div>\r\n171:         </div>\r\n172: \r\n173:         <!-- Step Calculation Breakdown (Shown on arithmetic / condition / loop steps) -->\r\n174:         <div id=\"teachCalculationBox\" class=\"teach-calc-box hidden\">\r\n175:           <div id=\"calcCurrentNumRow\" class=\"calc-row hidden\">\r\n176:             <span class=\"calc-label\">Current number:</span>\r\n177:             <code id=\"calcCurrentNumVal\" class=\"calc-val\"></code>\r\n178:           </div>\r\n179:           <div class=\"calc-row\">\r\n180:             <span class=\"calc-label\">Before:</span>\r\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
