{"step_index":2461,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-27T10:49:04Z","input_tokens":2337,"cache_read_tokens":185717,"output_tokens":911,"thinking":"The objective is to expand the existing set of canonical dual-approach problems. Currently, there are seven examples. Additional problems will be added across core topics to ensure each major area includes a baseline versus optimized comparison. The following problems were identified for addition: Product of Array Except Self, Longest Consecutive Sequence, and Container With Most Water.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# scratch/find_canonical_ids.py\nimport json\n\nwith open('app_build/dsa_problems.js', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    text = f.read()\n\nstart_idx = text.find('[')\nend_idx = text.rfind(']')\nproblems = json.loads(text[start_idx:end_idx + 1])\n\ntargets = [\n    (\"Two Sum\", 1),\n    (\"Contains Duplicate\", 217),\n    (\"Valid Anagram\", 242),\n    (\"Product of Array Except Self\", 238),\n    (\"Longest Consecutive Sequence\", 128),\n    (\"Container With Most Water\", 11),\n    (\"3Sum\", 15),\n    (\"Longest Substring Without Repeating\", 3),\n    (\"Merge Intervals\", 56),\n    (\"Valid Parentheses\", 20),\n    (\"Reverse Linked List\", 206),\n    (\"Search in Rotated Sorted Array\", 33),\n    (\"Find Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array\", 153),\n    (\"Maximum Depth of Binary Tree\", 104),\n    (\"Invert Binary Tree\", 226),\n    (\"Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock\", 121),\n    (\"Maximum Subarray\", 53),\n    (\"Climbing Stairs\", 70),\n    (\"Coin Change\", 322),\n    (\"Daily Temperatures\", 739),\n    (\"Binary Search\", 704)\n]\n\nfor name, lc in targets:\n    p = next((x for x in problems if x.get('leetcodeNumber') == lc or name.lower() in x['title'].lower()), None)\n    if p:\n        print(f\"ID {p['id']}: LC {p.get('leetcodeNumber')} - '{p['title']}' (Topic: {p.get('primaryTopic')})\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"NOT FOUND: {name} (LC {lc})\")\n","Description":"Find IDs of canonical problems","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\4b927fe1-f9a3-4b3f-9f8a-92760e157eef\\scratch\\find_canonical_ids.py","toolAction":"Writing find_canonical_ids.py","toolSummary":"Find canonical problem IDs"}}]}
